  "changes": [
    {
      "file": ".changes/add-biome-specific.md",
      "type": "feat",
      "scope": "laboratory",
      "bump": "minor",
      "packages": [
        "java@ender_infection_colored"
      ],
      "body": "Fix the natural laboratory chunk-lighting deadlock and open-door clearance. Import attributed HBM laboratory, ruined factory and arctic station structures, plus the MIT Church of Sin; preserve upstream architecture, licenses and source NBTs. Add chunk-bounded, resumable /enderbuild placement and optional local Lua Lab import. Stop naturally generating the old box-shaped laboratories while retaining six debug layouts, lift platforms and metal service ladders. GeckoLib 4.4.9 for Forge 1.20.1 remains required: https://modrinth.com/mod/geckolib/version/RBA7lJaW",
      "commit": "8eec4e05af7e6ccf28bd83e07996b2a026ead594",
      "commit_url": "https://github.com/fl749731-lab/ender-infection/commit/8eec4e05af7e6ccf28bd83e07996b2a026ead594",
      "author": "fl749731-lab"
    },
    {
      "file": ".changes/connected-highland-expansion.md",
      "type": "fix",
      "scope": "expansion",
      "bump": "patch",
      "packages": [
        "java@ender_infection_colored"
      ],
      "body": "修复节点忽略扩张计时、只搜索上方三格和偏向旧覆盖的问题。新增连通坡面与崖面攀升、高台前哨、旧感染带接力、按未覆盖地形与肥力选址、付费补建和旧节点记录兼容；半径只为可用前沿付费，母体升级/和平孵化保留网络周转金，高地收入与扩张搜索高度一致。增加原生 Forge 扩张回归与 /enderstrategy 诊断。",
      "commit": "f44e1a434e9ac8c97f36032a0f35bc8e05c12cce",
      "commit_url": "https://github.com/fl749731-lab/ender-infection/commit/f44e1a434e9ac8c97f36032a0f35bc8e05c12cce",
      "author": "fl749731-lab"
    },
    {
      "file": ".changes/crystal-armor-detail.md",
      "type": "fix",
      "scope": "armor",
      "bump": "patch",
      "packages": [
        "java@ender_infection_colored"
      ],
      "body": "重绘三套晶体护甲的穿戴贴图和物品图标。细化头盔、背甲、肩臂、关节和靴子，分别采用共鸣紫晶纹、余烬橙色熔纹和虚空青色晶脊。",
      "commit": "c8da94973198327c276ec7cd646705aca6eb7846",
      "commit_url": "https://github.com/fl749731-lab/ender-infection/commit/c8da94973198327c276ec7cd646705aca6eb7846"
    },
    {
      "file": ".changes/crystal-equipment.md",
      "type": "feat",
      "scope": "equipment",
      "bump": "minor",
      "packages": [
        "java@ender_infection_colored"
      ],
      "body": "为共鸣晶、余烬晶和虚空晶新增三套装备。每套包括四件护甲、四种工具和一把剑。共鸣装备强化抗感染和矿石开采，余烬装备强化下界采掘和防火，虚空装备强化空中作业和末影机动。\n\n新增九项末影感染进度。新世界开局以坠落陨石引出母体。早期侵蚀与畸变单位免疫弹射物，移动单位可闪现追击与闪避。",
      "commit": "91d09c9ae682bb8b5f267ba9e8d4138b5b6770b9",
      "commit_url": "https://github.com/fl749731-lab/ender-infection/commit/91d09c9ae682bb8b5f267ba9e8d4138b5b6770b9",
      "author": "fl749731-lab"
    },
    {
      "file": ".changes/crystal-ores.md",
      "type": "feat",
      "scope": "ores",
      "bump": "minor",
      "packages": [
        "java@ender_infection_colored"
      ],
      "body": "新增主世界共鸣晶矿及深板岩变种、下界余烬晶矿和末地外岛虚空晶矿。矿石使用独立的像素贴图与自然矿脉，支持时运、精准采集和经验。共鸣碎片可供晶刺弩使用，余烬晶体用于实验室灯板，虚空晶体用于抑制粉。",
      "commit": "67e1a1af0a141d80ab092bce1ff6c9e44bcb6320",
      "commit_url": "https://github.com/fl749731-lab/ender-infection/commit/67e1a1af0a141d80ab092bce1ff6c9e44bcb6320",
      "author": "fl749731-lab"
    },
